        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "One of the best hairdressing experiences I’ve ever had, Carolina is super sweet and attentive. She did an amazing job and my hair looks incredible. 110% recommend!",
        "time": 1675378668,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Melissa Olsen",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109329574373014243284/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLk_ofExGfCL-oyeEgHaRA5rcCUVx7foiiirS6u57c2hbYMZ1IK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Not exactly the professionals you would expect to see at a hair salon.  Left extremely disappointed, frustrated and my hair looking so damaged as never before, 3-4 different colors (orange-gray-black-yellow) when all I wanted was an ash brown medium length. I feel bad to show you the before and after picture.  My hair was long ( they cut it with a razor right below my neck!  And all could hear was mistakes happen?  I missed my lunch time from the hair professional and she still wanted to charge me, cannot believe it.  Owner tried to assist (after I explained several times that what they did was wrong) but why would I return to a place which they already messed my hair up so badly, never again.  Not even for free, no thanks!  I should have known, the previous lady before me was also complaining.  I would not recommend this place.",
        "time": 1555876226,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ruxandra Fatu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116533470334813429282/reviews",
